 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Indirect questions with if",
   "texto": [
    "For questions whether or not **si**: **Il demande si tu viens** is used (ask if you are coming).",
    "If the main verb is in the past: **Il a demandé si tu venais** (asked if you were coming)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "You ask with what, where, when",
   "texto": [
    "The word of the question is used: **Il demande ce que tu fais** (ask what you do), **Il a demandé où nous habitions** (ask where we live), **Il demande quand le train part** (ask when the train is leaving)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Time and place words",
   "texto": [
    "When counted from another time, some markers change: **demain** can move to **le lendemain**, **aujourd'hui** to **ce jour-là** and **ici** to **là**.",
    "Change depends on who counts and when."
   ]
